  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:00.591" end="00:08.591" ttm:agent="v1">[Verse]</p>
      <p begin="00:12.659" end="00:14.159" ttm:agent="v1">I got to go</p>
      <p begin="00:14.010" end="00:15.619" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Thousand dollar tee, Number (N)ine</p>
      <p begin="00:15.619" end="00:17.538" ttm:agent="v1">Thousand dollar jeans hold my nine</p>
      <p begin="00:17.538" end="00:20.808" ttm:agent="v1">You don't know what I've been through, what I've seen with my eyes</p>
      <p begin="00:20.808" end="00:22.927" ttm:agent="v1">Money come in, then I leave on the guys</p>
      <p begin="00:22.927" end="00:25.601" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">New glitter, stacked wrist, bust down on the watch (Watch)</p>
      <p begin="00:25.601" end="00:28.019" ttm:agent="v1">How you at my shows, but then wanna see me flop?</p>
      <p begin="00:28.019" end="00:30.726" ttm:agent="v1">I done made a couple hits, and now another bitch talkin'</p>
      <p begin="00:30.726" end="00:34.207" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Bulletproof vest, if he talk, I 2Pac him (Ayy, ayy)</p>
      <p begin="00:34.207" end="00:36.368" ttm:agent="v1">If you wanna run up on me, got a melon on me</p>
      <p begin="00:36.368" end="00:38.779" ttm:agent="v1">Harder if you kick rocks, then to throw a pellet on me</p>
      <p begin="00:38.779" end="00:41.463" ttm:agent="v1">Think you want to blick talk 'cause you want attention, homie</p>
      <p begin="00:41.463" end="00:44.168" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Got yo' bitch lip-locked, she release her stressin' on me (Ayy)</p>
      <p begin="00:44.168" end="00:47.696" ttm:agent="v1">She said, &quot;Don't leave, how you gettin' money?&quot; Can't believe</p>
      <p begin="00:47.696" end="00:49.606" ttm:agent="v1">That you actin' funny since the green</p>
      <p begin="00:49.606" end="00:52.806" ttm:agent="v1">I put 'em in a coffin, put a red dot on the beam</p>
      <p begin="00:52.806" end="00:56.806" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">&quot;Don't go,&quot; I already want to lea-lea-lea-lea' (Lea', lea', lea', lea')</p>
    </div>
  </body>
